35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The software holdings report only their own dashboard figures. This opacity threatens our quarter-end reporting integrity.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Recruiters fill support roles quickly, but never place shift supervisors or seasonal field crews in under four months.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,Both profitable exits sold quiet back-office tooling. The write-off ran its own premises and paid hourly crews.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Follow-on calls are double the model, and our credit line ignores unbilled invoices. This is a cash trap.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shion,,Deals with medical records averaged three quarters in security review. The rest averaged one. External friction is real.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
